          "name": "Output",
          "type": "FSimCallbackOutput*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Free the output data. Note that allocation is done on the internal thread, but freeing is done on the external thread.\nA common pattern is to use a single producer single consumer thread safe queue to manage this."
    },
